# Local database — rebuilt from migrations + seed. Never committed. The sidecars go
# with it: `-journal` in rollback mode, `-wal` + `-shm` in WAL mode. A sidecar committed
# next to no database is a corruption source, and scripts/db-reset.mjs removes all four.
data/*.db
data/*.db-journal
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
# NOT data/save_dumps/ — those are the committed backups (P11).

# TypeScript build-mode incremental state (composite: true in tsconfig.base.json)
*.tsbuildinfo
